    {
      "subId": "4131302",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Xiao",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413130201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413130201": {
            "id": "413130201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "So, is the matter resolved?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130202"
            ]
          },
          "413130202": {
            "id": "413130202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We took care of it, but—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130203"
            ]
          },
          "413130203": {
            "id": "413130203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "—Good.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130204"
            ]
          },
          "413130204": {
            "id": "413130204",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Are you really not going to see the Mingxiao Lantern?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130205"
            ]
          },
          "413130205": {
            "id": "413130205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "No. As I said, I am not partial to crowded areas. Especially at this time of the year.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130206"
            ]
          },
          "413130206": {
            "id": "413130206",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The Mingxiao Lantern this year is Skybracer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130207"
            ]
          },
          "413130207": {
            "id": "413130207",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, it's a super impressive-looking giant deer, let's go take a look together!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130208"
            ]
          },
          "413130208": {
            "id": "413130208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "\"Skybracer...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130209"
            ]
          },
          "413130209": {
            "id": "413130209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Huh, a Mingxiao Lantern nonetheless. A fleeting creation of human hand. It means nothing to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130210"
            ]
          },
          "413130210": {
            "id": "413130210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "If this short-lived spectacle is one you wish to witness, I suggest you go to the city."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4131303",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Verr Goldet",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413130301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413130301": {
            "id": "413130301",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Verr Goldet",
            "text": "Sounds like you and Xiao took care of business again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130302"
            ]
          },
          "413130302": {
            "id": "413130302",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "Word certainly got around, the news even reached us here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130303"
            ]
          },
          "413130303": {
            "id": "413130303",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Verr Goldet",
            "text": "*sigh* And yet, another year's Lantern Rite will soon be over, and he still won't go and take a look...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130304"
            ]
          },
          "413130304": {
            "id": "413130304",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "*sigh* ...All these long years and I've never seen him attend the Lantern Rite.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130305"
            ]
          },
          "413130305": {
            "id": "413130305",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "I'd go as far as to say, it'd be easier bringing the festival to him than the other way around...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130306"
            ]
          },
          "413130306": {
            "id": "413130306",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Bring the festival to him... Hmm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130307"
            ]
          },
          "413130307": {
            "id": "413130307",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Nice idea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130308"
            ]
          },
          "413130308": {
            "id": "413130308",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah! If Xiao won't go to the Lantern Rite, then let's bring the Lantern Rite to him!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130309"
            ]
          },
          "413130309": {
            "id": "413130309",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "...Sorry? Surely you realize I was joking... How would you \"bring the Lantern Rite to him,\" exactly?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130310"
            ]
          },
          "413130310": {
            "id": "413130310",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "When we were in the city checking out the festivities, we learned how to make Xiao Lanterns. We even found a food stall serving local delicacies...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130311"
            ]
          },
          "413130311": {
            "id": "413130311",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So much tasty food, so many pretty Xiao lanterns, not to mention... um... what else... Oh, the bygone heroes, his old friends.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130312"
            ]
          },
          "413130312": {
            "id": "413130312",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Aren't those the heart and soul of the Lantern Rite?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130313"
            ]
          },
          "413130313": {
            "id": "413130313",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Verr Goldet",
            "text": "You're not wrong, but where would we set all that up...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130314"
            ]
          },
          "413130314": {
            "id": "413130314",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "Now that you mention it, I wonder... We'd need enough space to set up our own stall. Hmm... There might just be enough room <color=#00E1FFFF>below the inn</color>.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130315"
            ]
          },
          "413130315": {
            "id": "413130315",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "Let's take a look and choose a space. I believe I know the kind of stall you're after...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413130316"
            ]
          },
          "413130316": {
            "id": "413130316",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Huai'an",
            "text": "Hmm, there should be a few styles we can reference, let me think..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
